      "uid": "zhcn:c460c9b83e9f25f594102a4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……“日本德比”的隔天。\n我的心里充斥着懊悔与无力感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15f0e15848bc29ba767b28614f626b3f37bdd03bdbf91cf26dccc3ee4b280b71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
