    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5be397850e2a516218d52454",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了谷野美酒和支持她的人，\n一定要让她平安地完成\nMC参赛计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c25bff43b60f59cd98dab3839cbefb6bb250be86bb4a0330c86610c825a121",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710f90e0a419bc538a965ef8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在心里如此发誓，\n把能做的事情都做了，\n却还是没能防止谷野美酒受伤……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bbf53488fa3c3082af5a4a61213e8a7ee767619b232c6d0982c922c34f6cd41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084311.json",
      "json_path": [
