      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdbcefceab61b841958da9fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我拼命地甩掉懊悔无力的想法。\n现在必须重新整理\n谷野美酒的复出计划……！",
